# Rules Sync

After each code change, check if `project-context.mdc` is outdated. **Update it immediately** without waiting for user prompts.

## What triggers an update

| Change | Section to update |
|--------|------------------|
| Add/remove/rename files or dirs | Directory Structure |
| Add/modify/remove model fields or relations | Models table |
| Add blueprint or change route prefix | Directory Structure, Conventions |
| Change API response format or core conventions | Conventions |
| Add/change dependencies (requirements.txt) | Tech Stack |
| Change user role definitions | Conventions → Roles |

## Rules
- Only edit the affected section, do not rewrite the whole file
- After updating, inform the user in one line: "Updated `project-context.mdc`: [brief summary]"
